# Only site/ is ever deployed (vercel.json sets outputDirectory), but a CLI
# `vercel deploy` uploads the WORKING DIRECTORY, not the git tree — so without
# this it ships the Python venv, the packaged Electron build and the frozen
# engine sidecar. The first deploy was 409 MB and 1,619 files for a page that
# is under 300 KB.
#
# Git-triggered deploys were never affected (they use the repo contents, and
# all of this is gitignored). This is purely to keep a manual deploy honest.

*
!site/
!site/**
!vercel.json
